### Pausar asignación de ruta (Status 5) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateAssignmentStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345,
  "status": 5,
  "removalReason": "Pausa por almuerzo del piloto"
}

### Cancelar asignación de ruta (Status 8) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateAssignmentStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345,
  "status": 8,
  "removalReason": "Cliente canceló la entrega"
}

### Finalizar asignación de ruta (Status 6) — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateAssignmentStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345,
  "status": 6,
  "removalReason": "Ruta finalizada desde API"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateAssignmentStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345,
  "status": 5,
  "removalReason": "Pausa por almuerzo del piloto"
}

### Sin RouteAssignmentId ni Status → 400 (ambos requeridos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateAssignmentStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "removalReason": "Sin datos requeridos"
}

### Status inválido (fuera de 0,2,3,5,6,8) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateAssignmentStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 90012345,
  "status": 99,
  "removalReason": "Estado no soportado"
}

### RouteAssignmentId inexistente → 400 (RAISERROR del SP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Route/updateAssignmentStatus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeAssignmentId": 999999999,
  "status": 5,
  "removalReason": "Asignación que no existe"
}
